If he actually tries to get it?  Yes.  

Fire Brand is an unaligned artifact, and as such any class can receive it 
by sacrificing enough.  In practice, it doesn't take long at all to obtain 
Fire/Frost Brand or something similar, though there are occasional cases
of someone having to wade through Trollsbane, Giantslayer, etc. first.

If someone _really_ wants an artifact weapon, they just wish it up.  But
an artifact weapon isn't _required_ to ascend; a plain old +7 longsword
will do just fine, or blessed +7 mace, or what have you.

